{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114801","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114801","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1511480101:0":{"text":"Ah! You have two tails!","source_cn":"你、你有两条尾巴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEA2365C5181C81E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511480102:0":{"text":"That means you're the champion of the Bloodhunt Festival!","source_cn":"这么说，你是猎血节的勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9E48F2ED3B88D9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511480103:0":{"text":"Whoa. How did you win?","source_cn":"哇啊——你是怎么赢得猎血节的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04685A069087B947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511480104:0":{"text":"They say the beasts of the forest are super vicious, and that no one survived but you. Is that true?","source_cn":"他们都说丛林里的野兽非常凶恶，只有你能打败它们，其他人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182CC975459A621A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511480105:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511480106:0":{"text":"Do you believe a god would kill their own followers?","source_cn":"你们相信神明会杀死自己的信徒吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89FE77A86A2DFA4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511480107:0":{"text":"Of course not! The Herdmaster is good to us!","source_cn":"怎么可能？神对我们这么好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC01C9145B6E8A21F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511480108:0":{"text":"Well, maybe some gods would do that. But the Herdmaster would never!","source_cn":"唔，其他神或许会，但兽群之主肯定不会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B967301B4E0C16B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511480109:0":{"text":"... I wouldn't have believed it either.","source_cn":"……我原本也不信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345B4B8A6031EEE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511480110:0":{"text":"Just think of the others as having fallen in battle. There's no need for you to know more.","source_cn":"就当其他人都是战死的吧。你们没必要知道更多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x253CEB1F5960E2BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male